id: web-save
name: Web Save
advancement: true
prerequisite: N/A
tpCost: 6
# An Instant from the body, the Ally moved by the table.
webSave: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  An Instant: a willing Ally on your Explosive Web moved to any other Square of it.
text: >
  Web Save: You may move your allies freely along your energy web.
  –Prerequisites: N/A
  –TP Cost: 6
  –Effect: As an Instant Maneuver, if a willing Ally is in the AoE of your Explosive Web, you may move them to any other
  Square on your Explosive Web.
